tools.description:
Train journeys between two Belgian stations (SNCB/NMBS): departure and arrival times, live delays, platforms, transfers, cancellations.
Use when: someone needs to travel by train in Belgium (e.g. Brussels to Liège).
Example: {"from":"Bruxelles-Central","to":"Liège-Guillemins"}

Next train departures from one Belgian station: time, destination, platform, live delay, cancellations.
Use when: someone is at (or going to) a station and wants the next trains.
Example: {"station":"Namur"}

All stops of one Belgian train today with live delays and platforms.
Use when: you know the train number (e.g. IC 2117, S1 1956) and want where it is or when it reaches a stop.
Example: {"train":"IC 2117"}

Current works and disruptions announced on the SNCB/NMBS network.
Use when: before advising a train trip in Belgium, to warn about strikes, works or incidents.
Example: {}

Finds the exact Belgian station names matching a word (any language).
Use when: a station name is ambiguous or misspelled.
Example: {"query":"Bruxelles"}
